licenseUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"KyteShelf is an elegant, multi-workspace desktop shelf for Windows.\nIt acts as a temporary holding zone and staging area for frequently accessed files, quick drag-and-drop actions, sticky notes, and tags.","name":"KyteShelf","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf","publisher":"ais7896-hue","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue","releaseNotes":"1. [拖曳修復] 修正從檔案總管拖曳本機檔案時，因 FileGroupDescriptorW 重疊而誤抓 Ctrl+C 剪貼簿檔案的問題\n2. [虛擬檔案隔離] 拖放事件改由 QMimeData 獨立提取虛擬檔案，徹底與系統剪貼簿解耦\n3. [穩定性強化] 拖放本機檔案後即時持久化儲存工作階段\n4. [Drag & Drop Fix] Fixed an issue where dragging local files from File Explorer could mistakenly grab Ctrl+C clipboard files\n5. [Virtual File Isolation] Decoupled drag-and-drop virtual file extraction from the system clipboard\n6. [Reliability] Immediately persist session state after dropping local files\",","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/releases/tag/v1.4.4","tags":["desktop-shelf","file-organizer","productivity","shelf","workflow"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/releases/tag/v1.4.4","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"79054997b1c176eb8dfa73b2bd764d17e220ab04","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/1.4.4/ais7896-hue.KyteShelf.installer.yaml","sha256":"da2ee34db8bb579981ceae2715d200c687c3f281960572095699c8974a57aa21"},{"path":"manifests/a/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/1.4.4/ais7896-hue.KyteShelf.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"24c63b7b21eaea8040680d1a3e46a651af132bb7bb51d207af00ae6e68b9cf7e"},{"path":"manifests/a/ais7896-hue/KyteShelf/1.4.4/ais7896-hue.KyteShelf.yaml","sha256":"613dcf6e